  "metaRegistry": "https://w3id.org/ogc/bblocks/meta-register.json",
  "name": "Building Blocks - ESA EarthCODE Building Blocks",
  "abstract": "EarthCODE metadata profiles (GeoDCAT / STAC / OGC API Records) for experiments, products and workflows,\nwith their workflow provenance linked to the Open Science provenance profiles.\n",
  "description": "Building blocks describing the metadata published by [ESA EarthCODE](https://earthcode.esa.int/) in the\n[Open Science Catalog](https://opensciencedata.esa.int/). They build on the\n[Open Science Workflows Building Blocks](https://ogcincubator.github.io/bblocks-openscience/) register.\n",
  "modified": "2026-11-25T12:19:44.934659",
